            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! Very rich &amp; moist! However, the frosting is runny, too much liquid. The next time I try this, I'll cut the amount of milk in half. Very simple to make, but I'll also likely use a bowl to mix the ingredients next time. Mixing the cocoa &amp; ingredients in a pan was too much work."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
