            },
            "reviewBody": "",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-09T03:47:12.829Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "1"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dani"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Oh what a smoking disaster. Please note, microwave times will vary! Besides the fact that in under 10 minutes it charred to become something you might expect to find at the bottom of a fire pit, it was not only too bubbly to support it's weight but also overflowed all over the (fortunately removable) rotating microwave plate. I can't say if this cake was tasty or not as I didn't dare put any in my mouth. However, it doesn't smell wonderful while cooking (even before burning). I know I'm crazy, but I think I'm willing to try this again.",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-12T15:12:05.777Z"
          }
